&lt;p&gt;By blending &lt;strong&gt;top-tier consulting rigor&lt;/strong&gt; with an AI-native workflow, you enable senior teams to perform with &lt;strong&gt;unprecedented speed and depth&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring every strategic insight is backed by robust evidence and structural accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role transcends traditional requirements documentation; you are the &lt;strong&gt;engine of execution&lt;/strong&gt; that translates high-level strategic intent into measurable, high-impact business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
