Complement phone outreach&nbsp;with multi-channel campaigns (email and LinkedIn) to&nbsp;optimize&nbsp;the lead generation process and build a robust pipeline&nbsp;






Conduct qualification meetings&nbsp;to assess prospects' needs and ensure seamless handover to Account Executives&nbsp;








Manage end-to-end sales cycles&nbsp;in the Mid-Market / Enterprise segment when&nbsp;required&nbsp;






Build meaningful relationships&nbsp;with prospects through genuine curiosity, empathy, and strong listening skills&nbsp;






Contribute to the continuous improvement&nbsp;of prospecting strategies, scripts, and outreach sequences&nbsp;




&nbsp;


Qualifications:&nbsp;




Native Arabic speaker and fluent in English&nbsp;(written and spoken) — both are&nbsp;required&nbsp;






1 year of experience as a BDR&nbsp;in a SaaS software environment&nbsp;






First experience in sales, prospecting, or customer relations&nbsp;is a plus; strong junior profiles are also welcome&nbsp;






3 to 5 years of higher education&nbsp;in business, marketing, management, or communications is a plus&nbsp;






Strong commercial acumen&nbsp;and genuine interest in Legal Tech and SaaS solutions&nbsp;




&nbsp;


Desired Skills:&nbsp;




Excellent verbal and written communication skills&nbsp;in Arabic and English&nbsp;






Proficiency&nbsp;with CRM tools&nbsp;(Salesforce or equivalent) and sales engagement platforms (Outreach, SalesLoft, LinkedIn Sales Navigator)&nbsp;






Ability to quickly build rapport&nbsp;and connect with senior decision-makers (CLOs, General Counsels, CFOs)&nbsp;






